{"id":"7646debd-0ad4-41c8-96da-ff7c11c8ce1e","name":"Vital Sign Monitoring","description":"Explore three heartKIT models accelerated by heliaAOT on Ambiq silicon: ECG denoising, waveform segmentation, and rhythm classification.\n\n###### On-device AI\n\nheliaAOT compilation works with Arm Helium MVE vector processing and Ambiq’s SPOT® low-power platform. View model results alongside live performance metrics. Learn more about [heartKIT](https://ambiqai.github.io/heartkit/) and [Apollo510](https://ambiq.com/product/apollo510/).\n\n###### Understanding the comparisons\n\nReference benchmarks compare heliaAOT with TFLM on Apollo510 in low-power mode with weights and working memory in TCM. Results vary with model, build, and configuration.\n\n- **Speed:** the combined gain weights inference times by each model’s usage in the demo, not total application speed.\n- **Memory:** the combined reduction covers three standalone benchmark images, not integrated application RAM or total runtime RAM.\n- **Battery life:** an MCU-only projection with sensor power excluded, not measured product battery life. Connectivity and usage affect real-world results.\n\nFor demonstration and evaluation, not clinical diagnosis.","duration":5,"tiles":[{"id":"360d6987-174b-4f60-bad9-c7861fcec6d7","name":"Signal Stream Plot","type":"STREAM_PLOT_TILE","size":"md","visible":true,"config":{"name":"CPU Stream","slot":2,"chs":[2],"fiducial":0,"primaryColor":"#00dfea","secondaryColor":"#bd6bf0","tertiaryColor":"#ff0019","quaternaryColor":"#38FF60","streamDelay":2000,"streamGap":2000,"fps":15,"displayYTicks":true},"grid":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1}},{"id":"7e3698f6-aa6c-457e-8be0-0bd7eb997d12","name":"Sparkline Tile","type":"SPARKLINE_TILE","size":"sm","visible":true,"config":{"name":"CPU Usage","slot":2,"metric":0,"units":"PERCENT","precision":0,"primaryColor":"#bd6bf0","secondaryColor":"#00dfea","min":0,"max":105},"grid":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1}},{"id":"6ccdc822-a494-45ea-9a13-e0c8295f2616","name":"Spark